span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>行业要求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk} \\geq 1.33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.33</span></span></span></span></span>：过程满足要求</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.67</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk} \\geq 1.67</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.67</span></span></span></span></span>：汽车行业要求</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>2.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk} \\geq 2.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span></span></span></span></span>：航空航天/医疗要求</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>八大判异准则</strong>（Nelson Rules）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>单点超出控制限</li>\n<li>连续9点在中心线同侧</li>\n<li>连续6点递增或递减</li>\n<li>连续14点交替上下波动\n...（其余四条用于识别更微妙的过程偏移）</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"质量追溯体系\">质量追溯体系</h3><p>现代制造要求每件产品从原材料到成品的全程可追溯：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[&quot;原材料炉批号&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;毛坯序列号&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;加工工位/时间/操作员&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;检测数据绑定&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;装配关联&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;成品唯一码&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;客户端溯源查询&quot;]\">graph TB\n    A[\"原材料炉批号\"] --&gt; B[\"毛坯序列号\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"加工工位/时间/操作员\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"检测数据绑定\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"装配关联\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"成品唯一码\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"客户端溯源查询\"]</pre><p>追溯系统关键要素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>唯一标识</strong>：二维码/RFID/激光打标</li>\n<li><strong>数据采集</strong>：MES自动记录工序参数</li>\n<li><strong>存储架构</strong>：时序数据库 + 关系型数据库混合</li>\n<li><strong>追溯查询</strong>：正向（批次→产品）和反向（产品→批次）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年精密测量与质量领域的发展趋势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AI辅助缺陷分类</strong>：深度学习自动判定测量偏差是系统误差还是随机误差</li>\n<li><strong>数字计量学</strong>：CMM测量不确定度的虚拟仿真评估（Virtual CMM）</li>\n<li><strong>X射线CT在线检测</strong>：无损检测内部缺陷，从实验室走向产线</li>\n<li><strong>云端SPC</strong>：多工厂质量数据统一监控，异常模式跨工厂比对</li>\n<li><strong>基于模型定义（MBD）</strong>：取消传统二维图纸，PMI信息直接驱动测量程序</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>在三坐标测量软件（PC-DMIS或Calypso）中编写一个箱体零件的测量程序：包含平面、孔、槽三类特征，使用3-2-1法建系。</li>\n<li>某孔的位置度要求为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span> Ⓜ，孔径公差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mn>0</mn><mn>0</mn><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi 10^{+0.05}_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1205em;vertical-align:-0.2663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8542em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当实测孔径为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>10.03</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi 10.03</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mord\">10.03</span></span></span></span></span> 时，最大允许位置偏差是多少？</li>\n<li>收集某工序连续20组数据（每组5件），绘制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 控制图，判断过程是否受控，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>设计一个零件的质量追溯方案：从什么环节开始记录、记录哪些参数、用什么存储方式、如何实现反向追溯。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>精密测量与质量控制构成了制造过程的验证闭环。三坐标测量机提供了微米级的检测能力，GD&amp;T为设计与制造建立了通用语言，SPC通过统计方法实现过程的预防性控制，质量追溯体系则为产品全生命周期提供了可追溯性保障。在智能制造时代，测量正在从&quot;事后检验&quot;向&quot;过程中控制&quot;和&quot;预测性质量&quot;演进，成为数字化工厂不可或缺的数据源。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"精密测量与质量","id":"精密测量与质量"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"三坐标测量机（CMM）","id":"三坐标测量机-cmm"},{"level":3,"text":"在线测量技术","id":"在线测量技术"},{"level":3,"text":"GD&T 几何公差","id":"gd-t-几何公差"},{"level":3,"text":"SPC 统计过程控制","id":"spc-统计过程控制"},{"level":3,"text":"质量追溯体系","id":"质量追溯体系"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CAM编程与仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/advanced-cnc-technology/cam-programming"},"next":{"title":"PLC高级与组网","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/smart-manufacturing/intelligent-production-lines/plc-advanced-networking"}}